  "description": "A flaw has been found in mozilla-ai llamafile up to .0.10.5. This issue affects the function llamafile_open_zip of the file llamafile/llamafile.c of the component Container Parser. This manipulation of the argument size causes out-of-bounds read. The attack is possible to be carried out remotely. Upgrading to version 0.10.6 is capable of addressing this issue. Patch name: 5ac1c4dbb76737fee71a54922df95342c667ba6f. It is advisable to upgrade the affected component.",
